 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs**
-*   **Inputs:** Voxel size $s$ (world units per voxel), camera vertical field of view $\theta_{v}$, screen height $H$ (pixels), and the desired maximum render distance or number of LOD rings $L$.
